{"id":"3eb1d15e0e8f389d","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat.md","title":"Boolean Satisfiability Language","display":"df-boolean-satisfiability — Boolean Satisfiability Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat","aliases":["73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat","73-df-boolean-satisfiability"],"display":"df-boolean-satisfiability — Boolean Satisfiability Language","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat</span><span>73-df-boolean-satisfiability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-satisfiability — Boolean Satisfiability Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；二进制词、单字符词及拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 是固定的背景项载集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\top\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(\\bot,\\top\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i\\mapsto p_i):\\mathbb N\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\">\\((i\\mapsto p_i):\\mathbb N\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\\)</span>；原构造子具有类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg:\\mathcal U\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\">\\(\\neg:\\mathcal U\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge:\\mathcal U^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\">\\(\\wedge:\\mathcal U^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vee:\\mathcal U^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\">\\(\\vee:\\mathcal U^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\\)</span>。项构造子的否定与逻辑层的否定按声明类型区分。</li>\n<li>分离假设为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\ne\\top\">\\(\\bot\\ne\\top\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\cap\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\varnothing\">\\(\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\cap\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\cup\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\bigr)\\cap\\bigl(\\operatorname{ran}(\\neg)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\wedge)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vee)\\bigr)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\bigl(\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\cup\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\bigr)\\cap\\bigl(\\operatorname{ran}(\\neg)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\wedge)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vee)\\bigr)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(\\neg)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\wedge)=\\operatorname{ran}(\\neg)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\vee)=\\operatorname{ran}(\\wedge)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\vee)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(\\neg)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\wedge)=\\operatorname{ran}(\\neg)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\vee)=\\operatorname{ran}(\\wedge)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\vee)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。单射性已包含在构造子类型中。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathcal U\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\)</span> 是候选项集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；在语义与编码递归中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\">\\(\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolStage}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolStage}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BoolForm}\">\\(\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\)</span> 由 Assertion 定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 是候选二元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolCoding}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolCoding}\\)</span> 的右侧量化全部分量。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 子句中固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=(\\operatorname{bcode},\\operatorname{bdecode})\">\\(\\mathcal B=(\\operatorname{bcode},\\operatorname{bdecode})\\)</span>。构造子、变量编号及二进制标签均沿用原接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle1\\rangle^i\">\\(\\langle1\\rangle^i\\)</span> 表示词幂。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{Var}\\coloneqq\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{Var}\\coloneqq\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\cup\\mathsf{Var}\\subseteq S\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi\\in S\\;(\\neg\\varphi)\\in S)\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in S\\;((\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\in S\\land(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\in S))\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\cup\\mathsf{Var}\\subseteq S\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi\\in S\\;(\\neg\\varphi)\\in S)\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in S\\;((\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\in S\\land(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\in S))\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolStage}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoolStage}(0)\\coloneqq\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\cup\\mathsf{Var}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolStage}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoolStage}(0)\\coloneqq\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\cup\\mathsf{Var}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolStage}(n+1)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{BoolStage}(n)\n\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{BoolStage}(n)\\}\n\\cup\\{\\varphi\\wedge\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{BoolStage}(n)\\}\n\\cup\\{\\varphi\\vee\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{BoolStage}(n)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolStage}(n+1)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{BoolStage}(n)\n\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{BoolStage}(n)\\}\n\\cup\\{\\varphi\\wedge\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{BoolStage}(n)\\}\n\\cup\\{\\varphi\\vee\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{BoolStage}(n)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{BoolStage}(n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{BoolStage}(n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(\\mathsf{BoolForm})\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall S\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\n(\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(S)\\Longrightarrow\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\subseteq S)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(\\mathsf{BoolForm})\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall S\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\n(\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(S)\\Longrightarrow\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\subseteq S)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n⟦\\cdot⟧_\\nu:\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n⟦\\bot⟧_\\nu\\coloneqq0,\\qquad⟦\\top⟧_\\nu\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n⟦ p_i⟧_\\nu\\coloneqq\\nu(p_i)\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n⟦\\cdot⟧_\\nu:\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n⟦\\bot⟧_\\nu\\coloneqq0,\\qquad⟦\\top⟧_\\nu\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n⟦ p_i⟧_\\nu\\coloneqq\\nu(p_i)\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n⟦\\neg\\varphi⟧_\\nu\\coloneqq1-⟦\\varphi⟧_\\nu,\\qquad\n⟦\\varphi\\wedge\\psi⟧_\\nu\\coloneqq\\min\\{⟦\\varphi⟧_\\nu,⟦\\psi⟧_\\nu\\},\\qquad\n⟦\\varphi\\vee\\psi⟧_\\nu\\coloneqq\\max\\{⟦\\varphi⟧_\\nu,⟦\\psi⟧_\\nu\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n⟦\\neg\\varphi⟧_\\nu\\coloneqq1-⟦\\varphi⟧_\\nu,\\qquad\n⟦\\varphi\\wedge\\psi⟧_\\nu\\coloneqq\\min\\{⟦\\varphi⟧_\\nu,⟦\\psi⟧_\\nu\\},\\qquad\n⟦\\varphi\\vee\\psi⟧_\\nu\\coloneqq\\max\\{⟦\\varphi⟧_\\nu,⟦\\psi⟧_\\nu\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists b:\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists d:\\operatorname{ran}(b)\\to\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\n\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathcal B=(b,d)\\land d\\circ b=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathsf{BoolForm}}\\\\\n{}\\land b(\\bot)=\\langle0,0,0\\rangle\\land b(\\top)=\\langle0,0,1\\rangle\n\\land(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;b(p_i)=\\langle0,1\\rangle\\,\\langle1\\rangle^i\\langle0\\rangle)\\\\\n{}\\land(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;b(\\neg\\varphi)=\\langle1,0\\rangle\\,b(\\varphi))\\\\\n{}\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\n(b(\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)=\\langle1,1,0\\rangle\\,b(\\varphi)b(\\psi)\n\\land b(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)=\\langle1,1,1\\rangle\\,b(\\varphi)b(\\psi)))\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists b:\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists d:\\operatorname{ran}(b)\\to\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\n\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathcal B=(b,d)\\land d\\circ b=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathsf{BoolForm}}\\\\\n{}\\land b(\\bot)=\\langle0,0,0\\rangle\\land b(\\top)=\\langle0,0,1\\rangle\n\\land(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;b(p_i)=\\langle0,1\\rangle\\,\\langle1\\rangle^i\\langle0\\rangle)\\\\\n{}\\land(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;b(\\neg\\varphi)=\\langle1,0\\rangle\\,b(\\varphi))\\\\\n{}\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\n(b(\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)=\\langle1,1,0\\rangle\\,b(\\varphi)b(\\psi)\n\\land b(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)=\\langle1,1,1\\rangle\\,b(\\varphi)b(\\psi)))\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\exists!\\mathcal B\\;\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\exists!\\mathcal B\\;\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\land\n\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;⟦\\varphi⟧_\\nu=1\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\land\n\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;⟦\\varphi⟧_\\nu=1\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Structural recursion gives a unique truth-value map for every assignment.</li>\n<li>The tags <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"000,001,01,10,110,111\">\\(000,001,01,10,110,111\\)</span> are prefix-separated at constructor boundaries; the unary terminator in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"01\\,1^i0\">\\(01\\,1^i0\\)</span> makes variable indices self-delimiting. Recursive descent therefore encodes and decodes in time linear in the displayed code length, so the coding cannot hide a superpolynomial change of representation.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>语法载集由有限层递归给出；闭包中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\neg\\varphi)\">\\((\\neg\\varphi)\\)</span> 明确是一个项。编码包的存在唯一性写入 Assertion，不再只依赖可解析性的文字说明；原标签和每个公式的比特串不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}$；二进制词、单字符词及拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\top\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"(i\\mapsto p_i):\\mathbb N\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg:\\mathcal U\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge:\\mathcal U^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\vee:\\mathcal U^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\ne\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\cap\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\