si)=\\langle1,1,1\\rangle\\,b(\\varphi)b(\\psi)))\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\exists!\\mathcal B\\;\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\land\n\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;⟦\\varphi⟧_\\nu=1\\}","display":true},{"tex":"000,001,01,10,110,111","display":false},{"tex":"01\\,1^i0","display":false},{"tex":"(\\neg\\varphi)","display":false}],"bytes":5498,"backlinks":[{"id":"d303539c48e08599","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{BoolCoding}$ 及编码包类型见 [[73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat]]；$\\mathcal B$ 在第一个断言中量化，不作为预先固定的包。"},{"id":"b62119f4f9a2bf93","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\mathcal B$ 满足 $\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)$；$\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}$ 见 [[73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat]]。"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}